        {
          "value": "ridge",
          "label": "Ridgeline"
        },
        {
          "value": "dots",
          "label": "Dots"
        },
        {
          "value": "milkdrop",
          "label": "MilkDrop (WebGL)"
        }
      ],
      "help": "MilkDrop runs the real thing: a WebGL visualiser driven frame by frame from your clip, in your brand colours. Where it cannot run (no WebGL, a headless render) the card falls back to bars. Bars, mirror and spectrum read the real frequency spectrum. Wave shows the clip's envelope with a playhead. Oscilloscope draws the actual waveform. Ring, blob, ridgeline and dots are frequency-driven too."
